usage: j3c -e gen [--project DIR] [--force]

Runs each assets/gen/<name>.j3 that changed since its last run; it writes
assets/gen/<name>.j3mesh through j3.gfx.meshgen. render, play, and build run it too.
A script reruns when its own file or j3c changes, not when another project module
it imports changes: run --force after editing one. --force runs them all.
Example and API: `j3c doc recipes meshgen`, `j3c doc j3.gfx.meshgen`.
